  "description": "Find the minimum amount of money needed to guarantee a win in a guessing game from 1 to n.",
  "target": 3,
  "pseudocode": "1. dp = new int[n+2][n+2]\n2. for len from 2 to n:\n3.   for i from 1 to n - len + 1:\n4.     j = i + len - 1\n5.     dp[i][j] = Infinity\n6.     for k from i to j:\n7.       res = k + max(dp[i][k-1], dp[k+1][j])\n8.       dp[i][j] = min(dp[i][j], res)",
